OL,3,GNEWSAArtist, 94, thrilled by House of
OL,4,ACommons exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 94-year-old man with dementia said he
OL,7,Fwas "very happy" to be given the
OL,8,Fopportunity to have his artwork
OL,9,Fexhibited in the House of Commons.
OL,11,FEric Fawley, from Blackpool, has
OL,12,Fproduced hundreds of drawings since
OL,13,Farriving at Greenbanks Care Home in
OL,14,FWatford, Hertfordshire, over a year
OL,15,Fago, after a fire at his home.
OL,17,FHis drawings and paintings depict the
OL,18,Fworld around him, as well as his former
OL,19,Fbosses at BT.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
