OL,3,GNEWSAArtist, 94, thrilled by House of
OL,4,ACommons exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FNirmala Singhvi, the lifestyle
OL,7,Fcoordinator at the home, said: "Eric's
OL,8,Fstory offers a warm and thoughtful look
OL,9,Fat creativity in later life, as well as
OL,10,Fthe individuality and imagination that
OL,11,Fremain after a dementia diagnosis."
